# Build context exclusions for the ECS Fargate image.
# See planning/11-aws-migration-plan.md

# Installed on the build platform — macOS/Windows native binaries (sharp, swc)
# would be wrong for the Linux runtime. The image installs its own.
node_modules

# A locally-built .next carries the HOST platform's traced binaries. Letting it
# into the context risks shipping darwin/win32 sharp into a Linux container.
.next
out

# Never bake secrets into an image layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Not needed to build, and they bust the layer cache on every commit.
.git
.gitignore
.github
*.md
.DS_Store
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.vscode
.idea
coverage
